01:33.180 --> 01:37.620
It's time for the Japanese international challenge.  It's Japan versus the Netherlands.

01:33.620 --> 01:37.580
Yokohama - International Stadium

01:37.620 --> 01:39.500
The Dutch team scored one goal in the first half.

01:39.500 --> 01:42.580
{mamonaku}The kick-off for the second half is about to begin.

01:44.660 --> 01:47.660
Japan is having a really hard time.

01:47.660 --> 01:50.100
I-I'm sure they'll come up with a way to win!

01:50.580 --> 01:55.220
Yes. It'll be all right. I'm certain they won't just lose like this.

01:55.660 --> 02:00.740
Yeah! We have to cheer them up, so they can make a come back!

02:00.740 --> 02:03.740
Locker Room

02:02.500 --> 02:03.740
You guys did well.

02:05.060 --> 02:06.980
We kept them to one goal in the first half.

02:06.980 --> 02:09.580
We need to catch up quickly in the second half.

02:09.580 --> 02:12.620
The Netherlands will continue their attack in the second half.

02:12.620 --> 02:14.820
However, we can't score a goal with everyone in the the back.

02:15.740 --> 02:18.260
Misugi will replace Sawada in the second half.

02:18.260 --> 02:20.260
Establish a defensive line.

02:20.860 --> 02:21.740
Got it, Misugi?

02:21.740 --> 02:22.740
Yes, sir.

02:23.300 --> 02:25.380
Midfielders, don't go too far back.

02:25.380 --> 02:31.020
Forwards, run behind their defensive line when we get the ball.

02:31.780 --> 02:34.500
Just pass me the ball!

02:34.500 --> 02:35.780
I'll score no matter what!

02:36.220 --> 02:40.980
Yes, we'll definitely stop their attack in the second half and pass the ball to the forwards.

02:41.540 --> 02:44.460
It'll be lame if we back down now!

02:45.180 --> 02:48.980
The Japanese team can't be defeated when we play as one!

02:49.820 --> 02:52.100
We have to win against the Netherlands no matter what.

02:52.540 --> 02:57.660
Okay, guys. We have 45 minutes to tie it up and then take the lead!

02:57.660 --> 02:59.860
Yeah!

03:02.260 --> 03:07.380
<b>Break the Dutch Wall!</b>

03:02.260 --> 03:07.380
<b>Break the Dutch Wall!</b>

03:09.140 --> 03:11.420
It's time for the second half kick-off.

03:13.300 --> 03:16.140
The first half was a one-sided attack against Japan.

03:16.140 --> 03:20.020
They've replaced Sawada with Misugi now.

03:20.940 --> 03:22.700
The Netherlands are leading by one goal.

03:22.700 --> 03:24.460
They are not replacing their players.

03:24.460 --> 03:26.980
The Dutch team kicks off!

03:26.980 --> 03:28.380
Let's go!

03:28.380 --> 03:29.060
Yeah!

03:31.620 --> 03:32.020
Willem!

03:33.460 --> 03:34.020
What?!

03:34.580 --> 03:38.540
Ohzora stole the Dutch ball already!

03:38.540 --> 03:39.740
He's really fired up!

03:40.060 --> 03:41.900
Here I come, Netherlands!

03:44.500 --> 03:48.060
Ohzora is surrounded by Dutch defenders!

03:49.780 --> 03:53.220
But he draws his opponents and passes to the other side!

03:53.220 --> 03:54.180
Hyuga has the ball!

03:54.180 --> 03:54.820
Here I come!

03:54.820 --> 03:55.980
Take this!

03:58.300 --> 03:59.660
You bastard!

04:03.420 --> 04:05.500
Taki grabs the loose ball!

04:05.500 --> 04:06.500
Taki!

04:06.500 --> 04:07.500
Good job! Taki!

04:09.660 --> 04:12.900
The Japanese team is moving swiftly in the second half!

04:12.900 --> 04:13.820
Taki passed!

04:13.820 --> 04:15.780
The ball reached Misaki!

04:16.900 --> 04:19.700
Misaki passes one Dutch player after another!

04:19.700 --> 04:21.180
We can't just lose!

04:21.180 --> 04:24.140
We must win this game!

04:25.700 --> 04:28.340
Misaki lost the ball!

04:28.340 --> 04:30.220
And Albert grabs the ball!

04:30.220 --> 04:32.060
All right! Let's go on the offensive!

04:33.020 --> 04:36.690
All Dutch players are heading toward the Japanese goal!

04:36.220 --> 04:37.180
Stop them!

04:37.180 --> 04:38.220
Got it!

04:39.380 --> 04:40.420
He's fast!

04:40.420 --> 04:43.220
He made it past both of them!

04:41.180 --> 04:41.700
What?

04:43.220 --> 04:44.700
The Dutch team continues to advance!

04:44.700 --> 04:46.660
You're not getting past me!

04:51.140 --> 04:52.660
I'm counting on you, Bernhardt.

04:53.300 --> 04:54.500
Okay.

04:56.540 --> 04:57.500
This is it!

05:02.260 --> 05:03.820
Yes!

05:05.220 --> 05:06.940
He's offside!

05:06.940 --> 05:09.460
The Dutch fell for the Japanese offside trap!

05:11.540 --> 05:14.500
Impressive work by the Prince of the Field, Misugi!

05:14.500 --> 05:18.580
He stopped the Dutch offense with a brilliant offside trap!

05:18.580 --> 05:19.380
Yes!

05:19.380 --> 05:21.140
Nice, Misugi-kun!

05:21.540 --> 05:22.500
Good work, Misugi!

05:23.060 --> 05:28.980
I'm impressed that he was able to execute an offside trap with perfect timing.

05:28.980 --> 05:31.260
It's a trick only Misugi can handle.

05:33.940 --> 05:36.540
Now it's a free kick by Japan.

05:36.540 --> 05:38.500
Hyuga, it's your turn to shine.

05:46.780 --> 05:48.100
Misugi...

05:49.100 --> 05:50.620
Go, Hyuga!

05:54.020 --> 05:55.180
Kojiro!

05:55.180 --> 05:56.140
Hyuga-kun?

05:56.140 --> 05:58.180
He's not moving!

05:58.180 --> 05:59.140
What happened to Hyuga?!

06:02.300 --> 06:03.420
I...

06:04.540 --> 06:05.500
I...!

06:16.700 --> 06:17.860
Willem!

06:19.500 --> 06:20.860
Here he comes.

06:27.140 --> 06:29.340
It's a one-on-one battle between Hyuga and Willem!

06:29.340 --> 06:30.420
Kojiro!

06:31.220 --> 06:32.860
Hyuga-kun!

06:32.860 --> 06:34.740
I'll play along!

06:47.180 --> 06:48.100
What?!

06:48.860 --> 06:50.540
He passed to Ohzora!

06:51.020 --> 06:53.700
We'll settle this next time.

06:53.700 --> 06:55.620
Japan's victory comes first!

06:58.380 --> 06:59.460
Hyuga-kun!

06:59.460 --> 07:02.060
Hyuga caught Willem by surprise!

07:02.060 --> 07:04.820
Hyuga and Ohzora are showing their excellent passing skills.

07:04.820 --> 07:06.700
Gustaf stands in Hyuga's way!

07:06.700 --> 07:07.700
Tsubasa!

07:09.020 --> 07:10.220
Nice!

07:10.220 --> 07:12.220
Hyuga passed to Ohzora again!

07:12.500 --> 07:13.540
It's mine!

07:13.540 --> 07:15.260
Willem caught up!

07:15.260 --> 07:16.820
Did the pass fail?

07:17.300 --> 07:21.540
Ohzora took the ball by force in front of Willem!

07:21.540 --> 07:24.660
No! He's going to shoot!

07:24.060 --> 07:25.380
Not on my watch!

07:29.940 --> 07:30.940
What?!

07:32.740 --> 07:34.100
He stopped it!

07:34.100 --> 07:35.700
Folt stopped it!

07:35.700 --> 07:39.900
He effortlessly saved the goal from Tsubasa's volley shot!

07:39.900 --> 07:41.980
He makes it look so easy!

07:41.980 --> 07:43.980
The Dutch Wall is formidable!

07:43.980 --> 07:46.660
Japan failed to score again!

07:48.300 --> 07:49.860
That was so close!

07:49.860 --> 07:52.220
I wonder if they still have a chance.

07:52.220 --> 07:55.100
That was a fine play by Folt.

07:55.860 --> 07:57.500
Owww...!

07:57.500 --> 08:00.580
Who are you cheering for?!

08:00.580 --> 08:02.060
I-I'm sorry.

08:03.060 --> 08:04.180
Tsubasa...

08:09.220 --> 08:10.460
Damn it.

08:14.900 --> 08:16.460
Japan cannot score.

08:17.820 --> 08:20.980
Their defense has improved with Misugi on the field,

08:20.980 --> 08:23.860
but they cannot get past the Dutch Wall!

08:24.460 --> 08:27.580
It seems hopeless, after all.

08:28.020 --> 08:31.460
You will be held responsible, Katagiri.

08:32.020 --> 08:34.940
Please be quiet and watch for a while longer.

08:38.660 --> 08:41.780
Japan is taking a risk and pushes their defensive line forward!

08:41.780 --> 08:45.020
They have matched the Dutch attack shifts!

08:45.020 --> 08:47.540
It's an intense battle in the crowded midfield!

08:47.980 --> 08:52.060
The wall you're facing right now is a barrier to the world.

08:53.860 --> 08:56.060
Let's see you tear it down!

08:56.060 --> 08:58.900
Hang in there! Hang in there, Japan!

08:58.900 --> 09:02.380
Don't be lazy! Run!

09:04.420 --> 09:07.780
All right. It's battle for possession in the midfield now.

09:09.140 --> 09:11.420
This is the chance to turn the tide.

09:12.340 --> 09:13.220
Aoi!

09:13.220 --> 09:13.780
Yes?

09:13.780 --> 09:15.340
You're on. Get ready.

09:17.820 --> 09:18.380
All right!

09:24.820 --> 09:27.260
I'm ready any time!

09:33.180 --> 09:35.740
Japan is substituting a player.

09:35.740 --> 09:39.260
Aoi Shingo will replace Taki.

09:37.180 --> 09:38.220
Good luck!

09:38.220 --> 09:38.920
Thanks!

09:39.980 --> 09:42.020
I'm counting on you, Aoi.

09:43.180 --> 09:45.020
Sure thing, Tsubasa-san!

09:50.100 --> 09:51.620
Go, Aoi!

09:51.620 --> 09:52.900
Got it!

09:55.900 --> 09:57.940
The ball was passed to Aoi!

09:58.900 --> 10:00.620
Nothing can stop me once I start running.

10:00.620 --> 10:02.500
I'm the "fast as a bullet" super-sub!

10:02.500 --> 10:06.140
Watch me, guys! I kept playing soccer for this very day!

10:06.140 --> 10:07.940
Nothing can stop me now!

10:13.780 --> 10:16.980
Aoi sneaks around the Dutch players!

10:15.780 --> 10:18.300
That's good! Run around!

10:18.300 --> 10:19.260
{tsukamaruna}Don't get caught!

10:19.260 --> 10:20.620
Go!

10:20.620 --> 10:21.780
Go for it!

10:25.780 --> 10:28.140
He's keeping the ball with agile movements,

10:28.140 --> 10:29.740
but he gets surrounded in no time!

10:29.740 --> 10:31.700
There's no room to pass!

10:33.780 --> 10:35.460
Aoi is down!

10:35.780 --> 10:38.300
Stop sneaking around! You're an eyesore!

10:38.940 --> 10:39.460
Damn!

10:50.980 --> 10:54.020
Willem effortlessly ran past Nitta and Misaki.

10:54.020 --> 10:55.460
He's going straight for the Japanese goal!

10:55.460 --> 10:56.740
He's fast!

10:56.740 --> 10:59.020
Oh! Aoi caught up with Willem!

10:59.220 --> 11:00.100
You're in my way!

11:00.100 --> 11:00.980
Here I come!

11:00.980 --> 11:02.020
Get out of my way!

11:10.980 --> 11:13.060
Willem is going straight for the Japanese goal!

11:13.060 --> 11:13.900
He's fast!

11:13.900 --> 11:16.100
Oh! Aoi caught up with Willem!

11:16.340 --> 11:17.140
You're in my way!

11:17.140 --> 11:18.060
Here I come!

11:18.340 --> 11:18.980
Get out of my way!

11:20.540 --> 11:23.500
Willem pushed past Aoi by force!

11:25.220 --> 11:26.940
Take a nap there like a good boy.

11:26.940 --> 11:28.940
O-Owwee...

11:29.980 --> 11:31.420
Oh! Look at this!

11:31.420 --> 11:32.580
What?!

11:34.220 --> 11:37.940
Incredibly, Aoi intercepted the ball!

11:37.940 --> 11:41.340
Shingo-kun may fall, but he doesn't get up empty handed!

11:41.340 --> 11:41.900
Just kidding!

11:44.340 --> 11:45.580
W-Why you...

11:47.820 --> 11:48.620
Hyuga-san!

11:50.500 --> 11:51.580
Good work, Shingo!

11:51.980 --> 11:54.620
That was a fine play by Aoi Shingo!

11:55.180 --> 11:59.580
-Brazil- San Paulo

11:55.540 --> 11:59.460
Aoi is running around after the ball again in the midfield.

12:03.140 --> 12:05.700
The Dutch are having hard time with Aoi!

12:05.700 --> 12:06.380
He's fast!

12:07.180 --> 12:08.860
Aoi Shingo.

12:08.860 --> 12:10.500
He's a good player.

12:10.500 --> 12:14.340
The Dutch defense is a mess from his unpredictable movement.

12:16.260 --> 12:18.820
This is getting exciting.

12:19.420 --> 12:22.420
Aoi Shingo has been sent to replace Taki.

12:23.100 --> 12:25.020
His athletic capabilities match that of Willem's.

12:25.020 --> 12:27.860
{oranda no}The Dutch midfield formation is breaking down!

12:28.660 --> 12:30.620
Incredible energy!

12:30.620 --> 12:31.660
Such aggressiveness!

12:32.100 --> 12:33.620
Don't forget guts!

12:34.460 --> 12:36.860
Aoi stole the ball again!

12:36.860 --> 12:38.860
The ball reaches Ohzora!

12:38.860 --> 12:40.140
Let's go, Shingo!

12:41.580 --> 12:42.300
All right!

12:43.380 --> 12:46.820
Ohzora and Aoi are heading toward the Dutch goal!

12:48.180 --> 12:48.820
Shingo!

12:50.660 --> 12:51.340
Tsubasa-san!

12:53.300 --> 12:54.860
Damn it. Stop them!

12:54.860 --> 12:55.740
Got it!

12:57.540 --> 13:01.060
It's a combination play by Ohzora and Aoi!

13:01.060 --> 13:02.540
Go, Shingo!

13:02.540 --> 13:05.820
Oh! Is this going out of bounds?!

13:05.820 --> 13:06.540
I'll catch up to it!

13:08.140 --> 13:09.100
What?!

13:12.020 --> 13:13.300
He caught up to it!

13:13.300 --> 13:14.060
Good!

13:14.060 --> 13:14.820
Shingo!

13:18.060 --> 13:21.100
He stopped the ball just inches away from the sideline!

13:21.100 --> 13:23.340
Incredible tenacity by Aoi!

13:23.340 --> 13:24.260
Hyuga-san!

13:30.700 --> 13:32.900
H-He's huge!

13:35.540 --> 13:38.420
That was like taking candy from a baby for Gustaf!

13:40.300 --> 13:43.340
Japan's chance has been ruined again by Gustaf!

13:43.820 --> 13:46.020
The ball is cleared to Japan's territory.

13:46.020 --> 13:47.580
All the Dutch players are advancing forward!

13:47.580 --> 13:48.380
We got this!

13:48.380 --> 13:49.700
Get back!

13:50.020 --> 13:50.780
Shingo!

13:51.220 --> 13:53.580
Time is running out.

13:53.580 --> 13:55.580
Can Japan score?

13:57.380 --> 13:59.380
D-Damn it!

14:01.300 --> 14:02.140
It's not over yet!

14:02.580 --> 14:05.300
Things were starting to look good. That was close.

14:05.300 --> 14:06.140
Yeah.

14:06.140 --> 14:09.140
The Netherlands are going to win, huh?

14:09.140 --> 14:11.780
The Dutch are attacking with their entire team again.

14:12.820 --> 14:17.300
Tsubasa, how will you steal the ball from the Dutch?

14:17.700 --> 14:19.780
Willem is in control of the ball!

14:19.780 --> 14:21.500
Misugi, let's stop him!

14:22.660 --> 14:23.900
Move out of my way!

14:30.100 --> 14:32.140
You're not going any further!

14:33.660 --> 14:35.540
Ah! Jito failed, too!

14:35.900 --> 14:38.500
Willem continues his attack! He's in front of the goal already!

14:38.500 --> 14:40.180
It's a one-on-one against the goalkeeper!

14:40.180 --> 14:41.540
Japan is in trouble!

14:41.540 --> 14:42.260
Bring it!

14:43.780 --> 14:45.180
Willem is in shooting position!

14:45.180 --> 14:45.740
What?!

14:46.100 --> 14:48.820
Oh! Aoi is approaching!

14:48.820 --> 14:53.260
Aoi got all the way back from Netherlands' territory!

14:53.260 --> 14:54.020
Bastard!

15:02.980 --> 15:05.700
Wakabayashi makes a big catch!

15:06.260 --> 15:10.220
Nice guts by Aoi, but is he all right?

15:11.140 --> 15:13.900
You put up a nice fight, Shingo.

15:18.540 --> 15:21.340
I'm fine! I have more energy than I need!

15:22.700 --> 15:23.740
I see.

15:23.740 --> 15:26.180
Then... run!

15:27.820 --> 15:28.340
Got it!

15:30.740 --> 15:32.940
I'm counting on you guys.

15:34.620 --> 15:38.300
The ball was passed to Ohzora and Misaki, the Golden Duo.

15:38.580 --> 15:39.820
Stop them!

15:41.500 --> 15:44.820
Magnificent passing by Ohzora and Misaki!

15:45.660 --> 15:49.340
However, Misaki is heavily marked!

15:49.340 --> 15:51.420
So is Ohzora!

15:53.860 --> 15:56.340
There's less than two minutes left to play!

15:56.340 --> 16:00.740
Japan absolutely needs a chance to score here!

16:01.780 --> 16:04.060
He can't make a pass from there!

16:04.060 --> 16:06.020
Can't he come up with a way?

16:06.020 --> 16:07.780
It's impossible!

16:07.780 --> 16:10.500
Sheesh! You're so useless!

16:10.500 --> 16:12.660
Don't blame me for it...

16:13.100 --> 16:14.260
We have no time.

16:14.820 --> 16:16.380
Let's do it, Misaki-kun!

16:17.060 --> 16:19.220
Yeah, I'll try to come up with something.

16:24.060 --> 16:25.420
What's this?

16:25.420 --> 16:27.820
Amazing! It's a pass using the opponent!

16:28.940 --> 16:30.860
Ohzora traps the ball, and...

16:32.500 --> 16:33.380
he got through!

16:34.740 --> 16:36.700
The ball got to Ohzora!

16:37.100 --> 16:39.700
He's going straight for the Dutch goal,

16:40.220 --> 16:42.180
but we're already in added time!

16:42.180 --> 16:45.020
Can he break down the Dutch Wall?

16:43.700 --> 16:45.620
You can do it, Tsubasa!

16:45.620 --> 16:47.500
Go, Tsubasa-kun!

16:47.500 --> 16:49.260
Not on my watch!

16:49.700 --> 16:50.500
Tsubasa!

16:53.740 --> 16:55.460
Willem stands in Ohzora's way.

16:57.220 --> 16:58.740
I won't let you stop the ball!

17:01.580 --> 17:01.980
What?!

17:03.700 --> 17:04.500
There it is!

17:05.980 --> 17:09.460
Ohzora Tsubasa's Santana Turn!

17:12.900 --> 17:14.860
Ohzora got past Willem!

17:14.860 --> 17:17.380
Go for it, Tsubasa-kun!

17:19.980 --> 17:21.540
And he's in shooting position!

17:21.540 --> 17:22.820
This form is...

17:22.300 --> 17:23.740
Go!

17:24.220 --> 17:25.220
There it is!

17:25.220 --> 17:26.340
The Drive Shot!

17:34.500 --> 17:36.500
Gustaf tries to clear the ball with his head!

17:36.500 --> 17:38.460
Will he reach it?

17:37.940 --> 17:38.460
What?

17:38.460 --> 17:39.900
Whoa!

17:39.900 --> 17:41.220
It turned!

17:41.220 --> 17:43.500
It won't reach the goal!

17:44.460 --> 17:45.660
It's Hyuga!

17:45.660 --> 17:47.780
Ohzora didn't unleash a shot!

17:47.780 --> 17:48.940
It was a Drive Pass!

17:49.300 --> 17:51.420
Score the goal, Hyuga-kun!

17:54.620 --> 17:57.780
A Tiger Header with perfect timing?!

17:59.340 --> 18:01.060
Folt reads the play and runs forward!

18:01.060 --> 18:03.060
He's completely blocked the shooting course!

18:05.580 --> 18:06.780
Hyuga fires!

18:06.780 --> 18:07.740
What?!

18:08.060 --> 18:10.500
But the ball flies to the side!

18:10.500 --> 18:12.260
He missed the shot!

18:14.060 --> 18:15.740
No, it's...

18:16.540 --> 18:18.020
Aoi!

18:18.780 --> 18:23.780
Aoi Shingo was running from the Japanese goal to the Netherlands goal!

18:23.780 --> 18:25.220
It's all yours, Shingo!

18:27.900 --> 18:29.260
Get in!

18:36.500 --> 18:39.580
H-He... scored!

18:39.580 --> 18:41.580
Goal!

18:41.580 --> 18:44.660
Japan caught up to the Dutch!

18:50.340 --> 18:52.340
Yes! Yes!

18:54.340 --> 18:59.060
The team connected with the ball, and Ohzora was at the center of everything.

18:59.060 --> 19:03.020
It's the super-sub, Aoi Shingo, who scored in the end!

19:03.020 --> 19:05.340
He has truly fulfilled his duty!

19:07.460 --> 19:10.020
That's the end of the game!

19:10.020 --> 19:14.700
It has been a tough game for Japan, but they tied the game at the last minute!

19:14.700 --> 19:17.980
A score of 1-1 against the powerhouse of the world, the Netherlands!

19:17.980 --> 19:20.100
This can be considered to be a great accomplishment!

19:20.540 --> 19:22.100
Good job, Tsubasa!

19:29.100 --> 19:32.260
Coach Edward, how was Tsubasa?

19:32.260 --> 19:35.540
Attack, defense, setting up in the midfield...

19:35.540 --> 19:39.100
I believe he displayed his skills in all aspects of the game.

19:39.100 --> 19:44.140
Do you think his performance will affect his future in Cataluña?

19:44.140 --> 19:45.820
No comment.

19:45.820 --> 19:47.540
There's nothing for me to say.

19:50.100 --> 19:52.140
We somehow made it.

19:52.660 --> 19:55.420
Our players did well.

19:55.420 --> 19:57.620
They managed to tie it up.

19:58.260 --> 20:00.420
It's not over yet.

20:00.420 --> 20:05.660
This game is nothing more than the first step in their journey to the world.

20:06.660 --> 20:10.380
Thicker, taller walls are waiting for them.

20:12.340 --> 20:20.340
Japan! Japan! Japan!

20:19.420 --> 20:20.340
Get up.

20:20.980 --> 20:24.380
Let's show our appreciation to our supporters who cheered for us.

20:24.380 --> 20:26.180
All right!

20:26.180 --> 20:28.380
You ran, punk.

20:28.380 --> 20:29.900
I didn't run.

20:30.620 --> 20:32.220
I don't know about that.

20:32.220 --> 20:36.300
Well, it's better than someone who only knows how to run forward.

20:36.300 --> 20:39.860
We'll have to fight on the same team from now on.

20:40.820 --> 20:42.220
Hurry and come back to Italy.

20:45.540 --> 20:46.700
Willem...

20:54.700 --> 20:59.060
I was thinking of showing off Dutch soccer in Japan,

20:59.060 --> 21:04.140
but it seems you guys stole the spotlight, Katagiri.

21:05.300 --> 21:11.740
Tsubasa Ohzora, Kojiro Hyuga, Genzo Wakabayashi, Taro Misaki.

21:12.460 --> 21:17.820
With these key players, this generation can take Japanese soccer to the next level.

21:18.500 --> 21:21.740
It will take some time, though.

21:25.620 --> 21:26.980
Tsubasa.

21:26.980 --> 21:31.780
I know exactly what you're feeling, now that the game's over.

21:35.940 --> 21:37.620
We somehow managed to catch up.

21:39.820 --> 21:41.260
Tsubasa-kun...

21:41.260 --> 21:44.940
But it was our total defeat as a game.

21:44.940 --> 21:46.340
Tsubasa...

21:46.340 --> 21:54.860
It has become clear that we're still too weak to win the International Cup.

21:54.860 --> 21:59.620
We must keep going forward!

22:04.020 --> 22:10.540
