22:10.060 --> 22:12.340
Their defense loomed like a wall.

22:12.340 --> 22:14.700
Their offense pushed like a tsunami.

22:14.700 --> 22:17.100
They've shown us the height of the world's barrier.

22:17.580 --> 22:19.140
The way we are now isn't good enough.

22:19.140 --> 22:21.220
We need to strengthen our bodies.

22:21.220 --> 22:23.380
I will challenge the world again!

22:23.900 --> 22:25.700
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:25.860 --> 22:34.140
